{"abstract":[{"text":"채점을 하려면 정답이 있어야 합니다. 그 정답을 만드는 화면을 먼저 만듭니다.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"3. 정답을 기록한다","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"튜토리얼","anchor":"튜토리얼","identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"이 단계에서 새로 만드는 파일"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Foundation"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"code":"import simd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"만 있으면 됩니다. 이 파일은 손 추적을 직접 만지지 않으므로 ARKit이 필요 없습니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"3.1","anchor":"31"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"여기가 원래 설계 문서가 통째로 비워 둔 자리입니다."}]},{"type":"text","text":" “숙련자 포즈를 등록한다”고만 하고 방법이 없으면 아무도 다음 단계로 못 갑니다. 그래서 기록 화면을 튜토리얼 한 단계로 만듭니다."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 기준 포즈 표"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import simd","","\/\/ …","","\/\/\/ 기준 포즈 표. 40자를 여기에 채운다.","@MainActor","final class ReferenceLibrary {","    static let shared = ReferenceLibrary()","","    private(set) var table: [Jamo: PoseFeature] = [:]","    \/\/\/ 실측으로 교체된 자모. 자리표시자와 구분한다.","    private(set) var measured: Set<Jamo> = []","","    init() {","        for (jamo, recipe) in Self.placeholders {","            table[jamo] = recipe.feature()","        }","    }","    \/\/ …","}"],"wrap":0,"showLineNumbers":false,"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}]},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"}]},{"text":"3.2","anchor":"32","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"같은 글자를 여러 벌 기록해 평균을 냅니다. 그리고 "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"관절별 표준편차를 함께 돌려줍니다."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" 이 값의 두 배가 초기 허용 오차가 됩니다 — 허용 오차를 감으로 정하지 않는 방법입니다."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 여러 벌의 평균과 표준편차"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":29},{"line":29}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":30},{"line":30}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":31},{"line":31}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":32},{"line":32}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":33},{"line":33}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":34},{"line":34}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":35},{"line":35}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":36},{"line":36}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":37},{"line":37}]}],"showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","wrap":0,"code":["import Foundation","import simd","","@MainActor","final class ReferenceLibrary {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 숙련자 포즈 여러 벌을 평균 내 기준 포즈로 등록한다.","    \/\/\/ 관절별 표준편차가 곧 초기 허용 오차가 된다.","    @discardableResult","    func register(_ jamo: Jamo, samples: [PoseFeature]) -> (mean: PoseFeature, stdDev: [Float])? {","        guard !samples.isEmpty else { return nil }","        let n = Float(samples.count)","","        var bend = [Float](repeating: 0, count: PoseFeature.bendCount)","        var spread = [Float](repeating: 0, count: PoseFeature.spreadCount)","        var palm = SIMD3<Float>.zero","        for s in samples {","            for i in 0..<PoseFeature.bendCount { bend[i] += s.bend[i] }","            for i in 0..<PoseFeature.spreadCount { spread[i] += s.spread[i] }","            palm += s.palmNormal","        }","        bend = bend.map { $0 \/ n }","        spread = spread.map { $0 \/ n }","        palm = length(palm) > 1e-5 ? normalize(palm) : SIMD3(0, 0, 1)","","        let stdDev = (0..<PoseFeature.bendCount).map { i -> Float in","            let v = samples.reduce(Float(0)) { $0 + pow($1.bend[i] - bend[i], 2) } \/ n","            return sqrt(v)","        }","","        let mean = PoseFeature(bend: bend, spread: spread, palmNormal: palm)","        table[jamo] = mean","        measured.insert(jamo)","        confusableCache = nil","        return (mean, stdDev)","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"text":"3.3","type":"heading","anchor":"33"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"사람이 읽고 고칠 수 있는 형태로도 기준 포즈를 적을 수 있게 해 둡니다. curl 0은 완전히 편 손가락, 1은 완전히 접은 손가락입니다. 실측 데이터가 없는 자모를 임시로 채울 때 씁니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReferenceLibrary.swift"}]},{"text":" — 사람이 손으로 적는 포즈","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":4},{"line":4}]},{"range":[{"line":5},{"line":5}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}]}],"copyToClipboard":true,"type":"codeListing","wrap":0,"code":["import Foundation","import simd","","\/\/\/ 자모 하나의 기준 포즈를 사람이 읽고 쓸 수 있는 형태로 적은 것.","\/\/\/ curl 0 = 완전히 편 상태, 1 = 완전히 접은 상태.","struct PoseRecipe: Sendable {","    var curl: [Float]              \/\/ 손가락 5개","    var spread: [Float]            \/\/ 인접 4쌍, 0 = 붙임, 1 = 최대로 벌림","    var palm: SIMD3<Float>         \/\/ 손목 기준 손바닥 법선","","    func feature() -> PoseFeature {","        \/\/ 손가락 하나의 굽힘은 뿌리·중간·끝에 각각 다르게 실린다.","        let weight: [Float] = [0.9, 1.1, 1.0]","        let maxBend: Float = 1.5   \/\/ 라디안. 완전히 접은 관절의 굽힘각.","        var bend: [Float] = []","        for c in curl {","            for w in weight { bend.append(clampf(c, 0, 1) * maxBend * w) }","        }","        let maxSpread: Float = 0.45","        return PoseFeature(bend: bend,","                           spread: spread.map { clampf($0, 0, 1) * maxSpread },","                           palmNormal: normalize(palm))","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"34","type":"heading","text":"3.4","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"자리표시자와 실측을 화면에서 구분합니다.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ‘ㄱ’을 다섯 벌 기록하고 평균을 내면 관절별 표준편차 15개가 도 단위로 나옵니다. 그 글자는 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"measured"},{"type":"text","text":"에 들어가고, 화면 위쪽 경고가 사라집니다. 이 경고가 남아 있는 동안 그 글자의 판정 결과는 믿을 것이 못 됩니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"TutorView.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — 자리표시자 경고","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing",